</head><body><div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">霖楓學苑 · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 15 堂 · 學生版講義</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">容量單位</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元五 · mL 與 L · 65 分鐘</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心陷阱：</b>🪤 1L = 1000mL（不是 100mL！）同重量單位一樣係 x1000！<br/>
<b>前置知識：</b>堂13（長度）+ 堂14（重量）單位轉換<br/>
<b>本堂目標：</b>❶ 認識 mL 和 L ❷ 1L=1000mL ❸ 容量轉換與比較 ❹ 容量加減應用<br/>
<b>對應教材：</b>《小學數學新思維》3上A冊 單元九
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>學生姓名：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
  <div class="lf-parent-summary">
    <div class="lf-ps-title">家長30秒摘要</div>
<div class="lf-story">
<div class="lf-story-title">📦 搬屋公司的挑戰</div>
<div class="story-body">
<p>小明嘅屋企要搬家，搬屋公司嘅叔叔話貨車空間有限。爸爸話：「每個箱嘅<b>體積</b>都唔同！」</p><p>小明好奇：「面積同體積有咩分別呀？」爸爸解釋：「面積係平面嘅（地板），<b>體積係立體嘅（成個空間）</b>！」</p><p>💡 <b>今日我哋學識咩係體積，同埋點樣計算長方體同正方體嘅體積！</b></p>
</div>
</div>

    本堂重點：<span class="lf-ps-tag trap">陷阱破解</span><span class="lf-ps-tag goal">掌握關鍵概念</span><span class="lf-ps-tag sspa">呈分試關聯</span><span class="lf-ps-tag hk">香港課程</span><br>
    <strong>學完本堂，小朋友將能夠：</strong>① 識別本課陷阱 ② 正確解題 ③ 應用口訣<br>
    <strong>常見錯誤：</strong>請留意講義中的警告框<br>
    <strong>家中鞏固建議：</strong>完成課後3題練習，重點留意陷阱題
  </div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>
  <div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">🏆 陷阱獵人·計時挑戰</div><div class="lf-game-desc">每題限時90秒！搵出隱藏嘅陷阱，答對+1分，連續答對分數加倍！留意題目中嘅「陷阱關鍵字」— 佢會話你知邊度最易出錯！</div><div class="lf-game-action">⭐ 開始挑戰 →</div></div>

  <div class="lf-story"><div class="lf-story-title">🇭🇰 香港生活數學</div>數學喺日常生活中無處不在！由茶餐廳計數到搭車時間，由買嘢找續到睇樓面積，全部都係數學。今日我哋就用香港人嘅生活場景嚟學數學，等你發現：原來數學咁有用、咁好玩！</div>

<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>一支益力多約 100＿＿（mL/L？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>一支大汽水約 2＿＿（mL/L？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>1L = ＿＿ mL？（同重量一樣，係 1000 定 100？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>3L = ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>500mL + 500mL = ＿＿ mL = ＿＿ L</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：認識 mL 和 L<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
  ① <strong>mL（毫升）</strong> = 好少嘅容量<br/>
     一茶匙約 5mL、一盒飲品約 250mL、一支水約 500mL<br/>
  ② <strong>L（升/公升）</strong> = 較多嘅容量<br/>
     一支大汽水約 2L、一個水桶約 10L、一個浴缸約 200L<br/>
  ③ <strong>1L = 1000mL</strong>（同 1kg = 1000g 一樣！都係 x1000！）
</div></div>
<div class="svg-diagram" style="text-align:center;margin:16px 0;">
<svg viewBox="0 0 420 280" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:12px 0;">
<!-- Front face -->
<rect x="60" y="60" width="1500" height="900" fill="#F0F7FF" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5"/>
<!-- Top face -->
<polygon points="60,60 80,40 1580,40 1560,60" fill="#E8F0FE" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"/>
<!-- Right face -->
<polygon points="1560,60 1580,40 1580,940 1560,960" fill="#D0E3FC" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"/>
<text x="810.0" y="40" text-anchor="middle" font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#1A3C6D">水箱容量</text>
<text x="810.0" y="980" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#DC2626">50 cm</text>
<text x="1570.0" y="1000" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#6B7280">體積 = 50×40×30 = 60000 cm³</text>
</svg>
</div>


<div class="lf-why">
<div class="lf-why-title">WHY BOX：體積 vs 面積 vs 容量 — 三者有甚麼不同？</div>
<div style="font-size:12px;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;">
<b>面積（Area）：</b>平面有多大 → 單位 cm², m²（二次方）<br/>
<b>體積（Volume）：</b>立體佔多少空間 → 單位 cm³, m³（三次方）<br/>
<b>容量（Capacity）：</b>容器能裝多少液體 → 單位 mL, L<br/><br/>
<b>關係：</b>1 cm³ = 1 mL，1000 cm³ = 1 L<br/>
長方體體積 = 長 × 闊 × 高（三個維度相乘 → 三次方單位）<br/>
<em style="color:#6B7280;">考試陷阱：題目給 cm 但答案要 L？先算 cm³，再 ÷1000 轉 L！</em>
</div>
</div>

<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1：選擇合適單位</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">一盒維他奶的容量約＿＿ A. 250mL B. 250L</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">答案：<strong>A. 250mL</strong>（250L 等於 250 支大汽水咁多！）</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：單位轉換<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>黃金公式：</strong><br/>
  ① <strong>1 L = 1000 mL</strong><br/>
  ② L → mL：<strong>× 1000</strong><br/>
  ③ mL → L：<strong>÷ 1000</strong><br/>
  常用：250mL = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>L | 500mL = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span>L | 750mL = <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>L
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">2L 350mL = ？mL</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">2L = 2 x 1000 = 2000 mL<br/>2000 + 350 = <strong>2350 mL</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 3：陷阱！</div><div class="lf-ex-q">1L 50mL = ？mL</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">1L 50mL = 150mL</div><div class="why">忘記 1L=1000mL！直接將 1 同 50 連埋！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確答案</div><div class="eq">1L 50mL = 1050mL</div><div class="why">1L=1000mL；1000+50=1050mL</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命陷阱：1L = <strong>1000</strong>mL，唔係 100mL！同重量單位 1kg=1000g 記法完全一樣！kg↔g = L↔mL = 都係 x1000！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>5L = ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>4000mL = ＿＿ L</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>3L 200mL = ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>5600mL = ＿＿ L ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>750mL + 650mL = ＿＿ mL = ＿＿ L ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：容量比較與加減<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
  ① 先轉成<strong>相同單位</strong>（全轉 mL 或全轉 L）<br/>
  ② 再比較 / 加減<br/>
  ③ mL 加滿 1000 → 進位 1L
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">1L 500mL + 800mL = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">轉 mL：1500 + 800 = 2300mL = <strong>2L 300mL</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 5：退位減法</div><div class="lf-ex-q">3L - 1L 350mL = ？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">轉 mL：3000 - 1350 = 1650mL = <strong>1L 650mL</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>填 &gt; &lt; =：2L ＿＿ 1800mL</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>2L 400mL + 1L 750mL = ？（小心 mL 進位！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>5L - 2L 300mL = ？（退位！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>2L = ＿＿ mL；3000mL = ＿＿ L</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>選單位：一枝礦泉水約 500＿＿（mL/L）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>1L 600mL + 400mL = ＿＿ L</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 進階層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>每瓶果汁 350mL，6 瓶共有多少 mL？即幾多 L 幾多 mL？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一個水樽可裝 2L 水。倒了 8 杯，每杯 200mL。水樽還剩多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>由多至少排列：1.5L, 1200mL, 1L 800mL, 950mL</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 挑戰層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一個水箱原有 8L 水。放走了 3L 500mL，又加入 2L 750mL。現在有多少水？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>一瓶藥水 200mL。每日飲 3 次，每次 15mL。一瓶可飲多少天？會剩多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>把 5L 水平均倒入 8 個杯，每個杯有多少 mL？剩多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活應用題（共 5 題）<span class="star">🥤</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>🧃 一盒果汁 250mL，4 盒共有多少 mL？等於多少 L？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">24</td><td>🪣 一個水桶可裝 12L 水。已裝了 7L 500mL。還可裝多少水？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">25</td><td>🍼 每支益力多 100mL。一打（12支）共有多少 mL？即幾 L？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>🚰 水龍頭每分鐘流出 3L 水。5 分鐘共流出多少 L？即多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td>🏊 泳池有 50000L 水。換水時放走了 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span>。還剩多少 L？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">五、課後功課 （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">基礎必做題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>填單位：一支汽水約 1.25＿＿（mL/L）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>4L = ＿＿ mL；2500mL = ＿＿ L ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>1L 850mL = ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>600mL + 550mL = ＿＿ mL = ＿＿ L ＿＿ mL</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>3L - 1L 400mL = ？（退位小心！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">進階選做題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>每杯水 280mL，倒滿 7 杯。共用了多少 mL？水壺原有 2L 水，還剩多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>A樽有 1L 500mL，B樽比 A樽少 350mL，C樽比 B樽多 280mL。C樽有多少 mL？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>便利店買 3 支汽水（每支 1.5L）送 1 支（500mL）。共付 $45。每 mL 的價錢是多少仙？（$1=100仙）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、本堂核心易錯點總結 （8 分鐘）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ 本堂自我檢查（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅陷阱</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 學習目標回顧 — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有陷阱類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>易錯點</th><th>正確做法</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>1L = 100mL</strong>（世紀大錯！）</td><td>1L = <strong>1000</strong>mL（同 kg→g 一樣 x1000）</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>1L 50mL 寫成 150mL</strong></td><td>1L=1000mL；1000+50=1050mL</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>mL 加滿唔識進位</strong></td><td>每1000mL = 1L，要進位！</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>唔同單位直加</strong>：2L+300mL=2300</td><td>先轉同單位：2000+300=2300mL</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>容量同重量單位搞亂</strong></td><td>L/mL = 容量（液體）；kg/g = 重量</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>減法退位錯誤</strong></td><td>借 1L = 1000mL，唔係借 1=10！</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>生活中選錯單位</strong></td><td>飲品=m/L；泳池=L；水塘=百萬L</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣一：「一升等於一千毫升，同公斤轉克完全一樣；大轉細就乘一千，細轉大就除一千。」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣二：「三種單位同一家：長度重量同容量，米變厘米乘一百，公斤變克乘一千，升變毫升都係一千。」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">認單位</div><div class="d">mL定L？</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">轉換</div><div class="d">L×1000=mL</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">計算</div><div class="d">同單位加減</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">進位</div><div class="d">1000mL=1L</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 三個單位系列（長度、重量、容量）都學完啦！記住轉換定律：長度 x10/x100/x1000，重量同容量都係 x1000！💪</div>
<!-- ═══ PARENT CORNER ═══ -->
<div style="margin:18px 0 8px;padding:14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF7ED,#FFEDD5);border:2px solid #F59E0B;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.7;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;font-size:13px;">🏠 家長角落 · Parent Corner</strong>
<div style="margin-top:6px;color:#78350F;">
<b>今日學咗咩？</b> 小朋友學咗<b>「容量單位」</b>。 重點：❶ 認識 mL 和 L ❷ 1L=1000mL ❸ 容量轉換與比較 ❹ 容量加減應用。<br/>
<b>最易錯嘅 3 個陷阱：</b> 🪤 1L = 1000mL（不是 100mL！）同重量單位一樣係 x1000！<br/>
<b>你可以問小朋友：</b>「你可唔可以解釋「容量單位」嘅最重要口訣俾我聽？」<br/>
<b>溫馨提示：</b>唔需要識教數學 — 只需要問小朋友「點解咁計？」同「有冇檢查陷阱？」就夠。
  </div>
</div>
